WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.830
<i>lt's a dream.</i>

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.240
<i>lt's dream.</i>
<i>This is obviously a dream.</i>

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:27.050
Look out!

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:36.220
Oh, no!

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:37.290
l've involved him!

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:47.310
Shut up, Kazuki!

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:48.780
What's the matter, Kazuki?

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.470
Can't you at least be quiet at night?!

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.810
l was killed...

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:57.150
Are you half-asleep?

00:00:57.650 --> 00:00:59.920
Darn it. I'll avenge my death!

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:00.680
What?!

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:02.480
Have you gone crazy?!

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:04.090
Hold it, you...!

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:07.490
Geez... How noisy...

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.030
What's the deal?

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.000
Seems like a second-year guy is acting up.

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:16.470
Oh, that voice... lt's my big brother.

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:19.540
Wake up, Kazuki.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:21.970
You jerk.

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:25.340
He seems to be okay for the time being.

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:28.780
Be thankful.
Thankful for the power of alchemy.

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:40.830
<i>New Life</i>

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:43.760
Morning!

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.570
Morning, Muto.

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:46.260
Hey!

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:50.630
l heard you went on a rampage in the dorm last night.

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:53.500
News travels fast! Who's the snitch?

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:54.610
Me...

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:55.330
Okakura!

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:59.410
Look! l don't have to say anything; these wounds say it all!

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:02.950
Whoa! To think the Learn-at-Home Karate l'd been taking

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:06.350
since my first year of junior high would become something so lethal...

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:08.180
l am formidable!

00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:10.790
Don't give me that.
Apologize!

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:12.090
Sorry.

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:12.790
Good.

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:15.030
You really gave us a hard time back there.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.530
Right, Rokumasu?

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:21.100
Yeah. You might still be fighting Okakura if Daihama weren't there.

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:22.570
Sorry...

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:25.230
So, what the heck was the dream about?

00:02:25.470 --> 00:02:28.540
Well... it was painful and scary, the worst dream.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:30.770
And on top of that, l can still remember it in every detail.

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:32.640
The abandoned building behind the school?

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:34.440
Oh, the haunted factory, huh?

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:37.850
Right! There's a girl l don't know in a school uniform.

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:41.420
l save her as she's about to be attacked by some strange creature.

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:42.650
Uh-huh, uh-huh.

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:44.720
And l get killed instead.

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:46.330
You don't beat it?!

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:47.060
What...?

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:48.760
Big Brother.

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:50.890
Hey, Mahiro!

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:53.530
Oh yeah, you're a first-year student now, aren't you?

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.200
Congratulations on your admission.

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:56.840
The uniform looks good on you.

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:57.770
Really?

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.140
l'm glad to hear that!

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:01.600
To be honest, l came to this school

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.740
because l loved this uniform and wanted to wear it.

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:05.000
Me, too.

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:06.340
As a matter of fact,

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:08.540
l came to this school because l loved that uniform too.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.810
Stop fooling around and let's go.

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:14.020
Good morning.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:20.020
l see... So Big Brother was also after this uniform...?

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:22.000
Kazuki! Your little sister's troubled.

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:23.030
You guys!

00:03:23.270 --> 00:03:25.930
You there.
Where's your approved school bag?

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:29.540
l'm sorry. l sort of couldn't find it when l got up this morning.

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:31.240
You lost it?

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:33.070
Where did you stop off on the way home yesterday?

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:34.770
Let me see...

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:36.200
Huh...?

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:37.200
Mm...?

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:41.050
Well, whatever...
I'll make an exception this time.

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:43.690
Kazuki Muto, Class 2-B.

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.690
Come to the teacher's room during the lunch break.

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:47.260
Huh...? What for?

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:50.050
Backtalk isn't allowed! Got it?!

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:52.550
Yes, l understand...

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:58.930
<i>l found him...</i>

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:02.740
<i>Lunch Break</i>

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:04.970
Hasn't Mita been acting strange lately?

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:08.540
Really? l thought he was already the most unapproachable teacher

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:09.740
in the whole school.

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:11.640
Thanks for waiting...

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:14.240
Oh, Kazuki. What'd Mita say?

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:16.780
Hear me out for a sec, he said...

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.490
Pull out the weeds in the school's back courtyard?

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:21.720
What's up with that?
What's going on?

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:25.420
How come you have to do something like that by yourself?

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:27.500
More like, why didn't you refuse?

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:28.920
l did.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:32.460
Then he says he'll ask Mahiro to do it, so l accepted.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.330
No way?! That's terrible.

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:35.870
l'm going to protest!

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:36.940
Wait, Mahiro!

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:37.770
<i>Green Juice</i>
Drink this!

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:38.660
What?

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:39.600
Can l?!

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:44.710
Pulling weeds and green juice... the best way to celebrate

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:46.040
my adorable little sister's admission to this school.

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.180
She's drinking <i>that...</i>

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:50.920
They're definitely siblings!

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:53.980
ln that case you want us to give you a hand?

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.220
Yeah, I'll help, too.

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:59.960
lt's cool. l can manage on my own.

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:04.460
But I'll probably be late, so be sure to save me some dinner.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:05.730
Okay, got it.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:08.940
Oh, it's first bell.

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:10.170
Shall we go?

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.740
A text message? l wonder who it's from.

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:19.850
<i>Take good care</i> <i>of your new life.</i>

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:21.580
What's this?

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:30.220
Such a peaceful town.

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:34.700
But they're definitely lurking here.

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:41.900
Phew. Finally done.

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:51.010
Man, why is it that school at night is so creepy?

00:05:56.950 --> 00:05:59.440
The haunted factory on the back hill.

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:04.930
Ohhh... Things have sort of been lousy since yesterday.

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:06.760
I'll report in to the office and get home.

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:07.920
Where are you going?

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:09.750
Where are you going?

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:13.000
Oh, l'm going to pick up my big brother.

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:14.260
How admirable.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:18.030
l was thinking l'd help if he isn't finished yet.

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:20.610
Are you finished with the work l asked you to do?

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:22.100
Y-Yes. More or less.

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:25.700
More or less, huh?
Well, that doesn't really matter.

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:28.150
My bag!

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:29.220
Where the heck did you...?

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:31.180
The abandoned factory on the back hill.

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:35.990
A fellow who interrupted my dinner...

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:37.750
dropped it last night...

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:41.450
Meaning, you.

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:44.100
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:46.230
Why are you alive?

00:06:46.570 --> 00:06:49.630
l'm sure l killed you, skewered your heart.

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:51.540
<i>l see. A dream, huh...?</i>

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:54.210
<i>lf not, l shouldn't be alive right now.</i>

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:57.950
Oh well. lf you're alive after that...

00:06:58.010 --> 00:07:00.740
then this time...
I'll kill you for sure!

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:11.320
lt's not a dream! lt wasn't a dream!

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:12.090
Then...

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:15.760
Who is it?!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:16.800
<i>I'll be there in three minutes.</i>

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.190
Hang on until then.

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:21.460
<i>What's the deal?</i>
<i>What</i> is <i>that thing?!</i>

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:22.700
Who <i>are</i> you?!

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:25.130
What the heck is going on?!

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:27.240
Whoa!

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:30.310
Whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:32.840
<i>lt's hard to talk while running.</i>

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:34.110
<i>I'll sum up the details,</i> <i>is that fine with you?</i>

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:35.280
Please!

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:37.140
<i>lt's called a homunculus.</i>

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:41.310
<i>lt's a creature that hides in people,</i> <i>transforms into people and eats people.</i>

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:42.780
Eats people?!

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:45.280
l came to this town in pursuit of it.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.360
And...l involved you.

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:50.790
lnvolved...?
So what the heck am l...?

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:51.390
<i>l see...</i>

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:54.030
<i>You still haven't remembered</i> <i>everything, huh?</i>

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:55.330
Remember what?!

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:56.800
<i>Anyway, don't stop.</i>

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:01.770
<i>ln order to conceal their existence,</i> <i>they never leave witnesses behind.</i>

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:03.910
<i>They'll chase you down forever.</i>

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.580
<i>Once you get involved,</i> <i>there's no way out.</i>

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:14.090
Whoa, you scared me there.
What's with the scary look?

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:16.390
Mahiro... What're you doing here?

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:18.960
You were late, so l came to pick you up.

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:20.060
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:20.960
<i>l've involved her!</i>

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:24.900
Run, Mahiro!
I'll hold him off somehow!

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:26.530
Wh-What're you talking about?

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:28.330
What's the matter, Big Brother?

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:29.570
Big Brother!

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:30.670
Run!

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:47.680
lt's a bit rough to move in this form on an empty stomach.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:51.720
This should do in place of the share l missed out on eating last night.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:54.960
Give her back!

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:56.660
Mahiro's got nothing to do with this!

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:59.260
Give her back! Give her back!
Give her back!

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:01.860
Don't be getting carried away...

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:08.000
This body created with alchemy...

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:11.410
won't take anything except the power of alchemy.

00:09:11.810 --> 00:09:14.250
The power of...alchemy?

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:22.620
<i>Can you hear me...?</i>

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:27.090
You're dead because you plunged ahead

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:30.860
without thinking, gauging the situation or considering your own ability...

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:37.540
But... you attempted to save me.

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:40.140
l've become somewhat interested in you.

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:43.470
Kakugane!

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:48.150
A paranormal alloy forged by concentrating the essence of alchemy.

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:53.580
lt functions in response to the deepest part of the human mind,

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:54.880
the human instinct.

00:09:56.390 --> 00:10:00.450
lt will awaken the survival instinct as a substitute for the heart.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:05.230
You will obtain the power to live one more time.

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:08.660
And at the same time...

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:11.930
you'll obtain one other power.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:14.270
That is the power to fight,

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:17.540
which functions according to the fighting instinct of people.

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:21.210
That's the primary application of kakugane...

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:23.220
You don't know when to quit...

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:26.720
You're life should've run out last night...

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:29.080
You will give back Mahiro...

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:31.330
Dream on...

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:33.820
You'll be happily eaten up together with your little sister.

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.500
You jerk.

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.870
You fool...
You still don't get it?

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:50.740
Y-You!

00:10:51.050 --> 00:10:52.140
Buso Renkin.

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:53.750
Valkyrie Skirt.

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:03.090
What?

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:17.800
Y-You! From last night...

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:29.320
Death Scythe Buso Renkin.

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:35.950
l see...You're...an...alchemy...

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:42.530
Mahiro!

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:48.900
l remember.

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:51.670
Last night... on the way home from school,

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:53.600
l saw a light in the haunted factory.

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:56.910
And when l went to check it out, you were about to be eaten by Mita.

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:57.670
No.

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:00.880
l just pretended to be defenseless and drew him in.

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:01.840
You're kidding...

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:02.780
lt's true.

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:05.210
So l died because of a misunderstanding...?

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:06.650
That's really lame.

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:08.180
Mm... Mmm.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:09.960
Mahiro. Are you okay?!

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:13.220
She's probably much more okay than you are.

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:15.420
There's absolutely nothing wrong with her.

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:18.790
l see. l can breathe a little easier hearing that.

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:20.430
You're a strange guy.

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:22.670
Now and last night,

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:27.040
you say you've had it with fear and pain, and yet you're dauntless?

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:36.250
Either way, l've kind of... taken a liking to you.

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:39.380
<i>Health Room</i>

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:40.180
Here it is!

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:41.790
lt really is in the dictionary.

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:43.410
Alchemy...

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:45.260
The primevil integrated science technology

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:48.890
that took all of Europe by storm before the modern age.

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:51.600
Attempts were made to do things

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:54.500
such as change lead to gold and create an elixir...for eternal life.

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:56.870
These attempts were not successful,

00:12:56.940 --> 00:12:58.630
but this would become the foundation for modern science.

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:01.610
What's the matter?
You've got a weird look on your face.

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:04.840
lt's...it's nothing. l was born with this!

00:13:05.350 --> 00:13:07.510
l see. That's rough.

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:09.440
Huh? Wait a minute.

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:11.850
You just said there it wasn't successful.

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:14.690
Just in the realm of common sense.

00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:18.020
Alchemy achieved two paranormal successes

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:20.150
immeasurable with common sense.

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:23.290
Those two successes are homunculi and Buso Renkin.

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:25.730
Homunculi and Buso Renkin...

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:30.100
Homunculi are the product of research on artificial life.

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:33.840
Buso Renkin is the result of tactical munitions development.

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:36.940
However, they were both extremely dangerous.

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:40.150
ln the end, these two were completely concealed...

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:44.480
and ended up controlled by the hands of those who understood alchemy.

00:13:45.320 --> 00:13:48.550
However, there are presently some who have slipped through those cracks

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:50.420
to scatter throughout the world.

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:53.390
And they continue to devour people under the cover of darkness.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:54.960
The haunted factory!

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:59.230
lt's a hideout for the homunculi. l'm off to defeat the rest.

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:00.530
Buso Renkin.

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:04.370
l'm going, too! lf there's something l can do to help...

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:05.230
Whoa!

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:07.370
Whoa-whoa...Ow-ow-ow-ow.

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:09.740
You stay away.

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:14.000
l didn't give you a kakugane to get you to fight.

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:16.580
l felt yours was a life worth saving.

00:14:17.490 --> 00:14:20.420
l told you about the homunculi and Buso Renkin because...

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:23.720
l want you to grasp the situation and handle things calmly.

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:26.220
Battle is <i>my</i> mission!

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:29.190
B-But still...

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:30.020
Yikes.

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:31.160
Just stay away!

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.160
Ow-ow-ow-ow.

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:36.000
Think about it!
What about your little sister?

00:14:36.740 --> 00:14:39.440
Are you going to leave her in the health office at night

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:41.840
once she wakes up from having a frightening experience in a nightmare?

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:42.870
Oh...

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:45.570
Let me tell you this since you don't seem to be aware of it.

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:48.850
You're attempting to determine your future.

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:52.610
lt'll be your normal world if you turn back. lt'll be a world of battle if you come.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:56.560
You should know which world it is you belong in without my saying it, right?

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:00.760
l've no intention of involving you any further.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:06.490
You stay away. You must not come.

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:11.600
Go home with your little sister.

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:21.250
Mmm... l don't know what it is.

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:24.180
l feel like l've had a really scary experience.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:25.980
She just doesn't seem to be waking up...

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:28.350
Would having more work?

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:30.420
This, and this, and this while we're at it.

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:31.590
Stop it, you're freaking me out!

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:36.060
That's right. l fell in the schoolyard and hit my head.

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:39.230
Ohh, l'm kind of cold.

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:41.070
lt's because you're not wearing a jacket.

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:41.800
Here.

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:43.370
Thanks.

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:49.440
Say, Mahiro. How tall are you now?

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:52.340
Umm, l'm five-three.

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:54.840
Really? l see...

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:58.620
<i>Those shoulders were sure small...</i>

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:01.890
Thanks, Big Brother.

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:04.520
l'm okay now.
Let's hurry back to the dorm.

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:06.490
Big Brother.

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:08.450
Okay.

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:09.630
Let's hurry back!

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:10.360
R-Right.

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:11.500
Let's run, Mahiro!

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:12.090
We'll dash.

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:12.570
Huh?

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:13.890
Wh-Why?

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.700
Why?

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:24.040
I'll splatter your guts!

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:32.150
lt's a woman.

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:33.640
She's our prey...

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:36.390
<i>You're</i> the ones who're the prey!

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:43.860
<i>There's too many of them.</i>

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:46.130
<i>This is more than just a simple hideout!</i>

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:52.600
The woman Mita talked about last night...

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:55.480
Last one!

00:16:57.010 --> 00:17:00.140
l see... You're the alchemist warrior.

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:05.650
The Buso Renkin expert chosen from among those who understand alchemy.

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:09.290
However, don't think you can just march in by yourself and win!

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:11.860
l'm <i>always</i> by myself. Bring it!

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:15.360
Just what l want.

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:18.490
l've got her, Mr. Saruwatari!

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:20.270
Tsk. He hid in a corpse!

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:23.660
lt's tough by yourself, eh,
Renkin warrior?

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:24.800
Let me go!

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:27.110
You little...!

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:36.550
<i>That is the power to fight,</i>

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:39.650
<i>which functions according to</i> <i>the fighting instinct of people.</i>

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:43.390
<i>That's the primary application</i> <i>of kakugane...</i>

00:17:44.030 --> 00:17:47.220
<i>The possessor converts their latent</i> <i>fighting strength into form</i>

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:50.000
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:53.530
<i>Control! Determination! And Roar!</i>

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:54.990
<i>The name...</i>

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:56.500
Buso Renkin!

00:17:58.370 --> 00:17:59.500
l'm back.

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:03.740
Hi, Mahiro.

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:05.140
Huh? Where's Kazuki?

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:07.010
You little, you little, you little, you little.

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:08.810
We were together until we got to the entrance.

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:11.080
But then, he said he had some business and went out again.

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:14.780
This late? lt couldn't wait until tomorrow?

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:17.720
Yeah. l tried asking him that too.

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:21.120
But he said he had to go now, no matter what.

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:29.300
Wh-What...?

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:33.770
l guess we both had a trick up our sleeves, eh?

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:36.670
Competing strengths with me? lnteresting!

00:18:42.380 --> 00:18:44.820
Pierce through, my Buso Renkin!

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:48.420
The ornamental cloth is turning into energy.

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:52.550
What?

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:57.860
How powerful!

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:15.150
You! What about your little sister?!

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:17.610
lt's okay. l made sure to take her home!

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:21.880
l ran full speed for thirty minutes.
But l've still got lots of energy...

00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:24.550
You're at your limit.

00:19:25.090 --> 00:19:27.430
Why did you come?! l told you not to.

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:29.390
l couldn't choose which one...

00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:30.830
What do you mean?

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:32.700
Mahiro's important to me.

00:19:33.430 --> 00:19:35.460
But l didn't want to make you come here by yourself!

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:41.370
Look below your feet.

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:45.810
Whoa! Wh-What's this?

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:47.220
l told you.

00:19:47.650 --> 00:19:51.850
This is how they do things. lt seems this isn't just a hideout.

00:19:52.650 --> 00:19:54.450
The enemy here have been wiped out,

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:58.050
but more of these man-eaters might still be lurking somewhere in town.

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:02.560
No way... Monsters like that still?

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:04.760
The situation's worse than l thought.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:07.560
You should back out this time for sure.

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:09.740
That's all the more reason l can't back out.

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:12.300
lf such things are lurking in town...

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:14.270
Mahiro and everyone will be in danger.

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:18.610
l have the power to fight that you gave me.

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:26.320
<i>lt's different from last night...</i>

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:29.050
<i>This time he's attempting</i> <i>to plunge ahead,</i>

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.220
<i>even knowing everything,</i> <i>and aware of the danger.</i>

00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:39.030
l'm saying this for your own good you know.

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:41.900
Thanks. But, sorry.

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:45.030
No way can l just sit here and do nothing.

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:47.800
I'll help with the monster extermination!

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:50.200
<i>Kazuki Muto...</i>

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:53.910
<i>This boy has the qualities of</i> <i>a just warrior within.</i>

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:58.210
You've no intention of listening even if l say no, right?

00:20:58.820 --> 00:20:59.190
Right!

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:00.950
Okay, fine.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:05.560
I'll work you hard as a warrior apprentice!

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:08.590
However, l don't want you dying on me ever again...

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:11.890
You are to follow my instructions from now on! Got it?!

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:14.130
Roger! So...

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:15.200
Now what?!

00:21:16.270 --> 00:21:18.430
What's your name...?

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:22.570
Ugh... Sorry, l forgot to tell you.

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:26.570
Listen up. My name's...

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:30.080
Tokiko...Tokiko Tsumura.

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:32.520
Tokiko...

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:45.490
The boy to whom l've given the kakugane.

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:47.730
His Busorenkin is powerful.

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:50.390
But he doesn't understand anything.

00:21:51.300 --> 00:21:53.600
Next time, "The True Form Homunculus."

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:55.960
I'll splatter your guts!
